{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-115.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ、ごめんなさい治します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ黒髪だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ色抜けてきたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり３年染め続けただけある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくメンバーが怪我したときや体調崩したときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対処方や何が効くのか、相談を受けるんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ななみんに聞くと必ず答えが返ってくる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれるんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでこんなに身体に詳しくなったのかなと振り返ると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分自身体が弱いから、 普段から気をつけたり経験として身についた所も少しはあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどは、親や友達が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくれて 色々調べて教えてくれたり、支えてくれたことの経験が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知識になってるなーって思ったのよ、こないだお風呂入ってるときにふとね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、んー、感謝しなきゃなぁとしみじみ感じたのよ、お風呂入ってるときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんもさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしが咳してたら咳には何が良いとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしが貧血だって言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貧血には何が良いとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会やコメントでわざわざ教えてくれるしね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくない？わざわざさ、わたしの体を気遣ってくれるために握手に来てくれたり、コメントしてくれたりさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかさ、頑張んなきゃなって思ったよ、お風呂入ってるとき 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今さ、ベッドの中なんだけどさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の枕カバーすごい良い香りする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ柔軟剤の配分うまくいった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まででいちばんうまくいった香り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枕に顔うずめながらブログ打ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーー風邪治りそうーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"語尾に \"〜さ\"ってつけるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道のなまりらしいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってびっくりしたさ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われてみたら確かに、テレビであんまり聞かないね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週発売のanan アイドル特集で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂載ってます((o(^^)o))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女性が好きなアイドルと言う枠で...とっても嬉しいことだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして更に、アイドルanan選抜の８人の中に選んで頂いて、モデルさんみたいに撮っても